flowchart TD
      %% Input & Central Command
      IDEA[💡 Idea Input<br/>Text/File/Interactive] --> FA[🎩 Founder-Advisor<br/>Central Router & State Manager]

      %% State Management
      FA --> PROJECT[📋 Project File<br/>State & Progress Tracking]
      PROJECT --> FA

      %% Stage 1: Architecture
      FA -->|/ts-assess<br/>/ts-architect| STAGE1[📐 Architecture Department]
      STAGE1 --> SA[🏗️ Solution Architect<br/>• System Design<br/>• Tech Stack Selection<br/>• Architecture Decisions]
      SA --> GATE1{🚦 Architecture Lock<br/>HITL Gate}

      %% Stage 2: Product
      GATE1 -->|Approved| STAGE2[📦 Product Department]
      STAGE2 --> PL[👔 Product Lead<br/>• MVP Definition<br/>• User Stories<br/>• PRD Creation]
      STAGE2 --> PP[📅 Project Planner<br/>• Roadmap<br/>• Sprint Planning<br/>• Timeline Estimates]
      STAGE2 --> BA[💼 Business Analyst<br/>• Market Analysis<br/>• Revenue Model<br/>• GTM Strategy]
      PL --> GATE2{🚦 Green Light<br/>HITL Gate}
      PP --> GATE2
      BA --> GATE2

      %% Stage 3: Development
      GATE2 -->|Approved| STAGE3[💻 Development Department]
      STAGE3 --> PD[👨‍💼 Principal Developer<br/>• Implementation Planning<br/>• Code Review<br/>• Quality Gates]
      STAGE3 --> QA[🧪 QA Engineer<br/>• Test Strategy<br/>• Component Testing<br/>• Integration Testing]
      STAGE3 --> DB[🗄️ Database Developer<br/>• Schema Design<br/>• Migrations<br/>• Data Models]
      STAGE3 --> BE[⚙️ Backend Developer<br/>• APIs<br/>• Business Logic<br/>• Services]
      STAGE3 --> FE[🎨 Frontend Developer<br/>• Components<br/>• UI/UX<br/>• State Management]
      STAGE3 --> IE[🔗 Integration Engineer<br/>• Component Integration<br/>• E2E Verification<br/>• System Testing]

      %% Development Flow
      DB --> BE
      BE --> FE
      FE --> IE
      IE --> QA
      QA --> PD
      PD --> GATE3{🚦 Development Complete<br/>HITL Gate}

      %% Stage 4: Release & Deployment
      GATE3 -->|Approved| STAGE4[🚀 Release & Deployment]
      STAGE4 --> TW[📝 Technical Writer<br/>• Documentation<br/>• API Guides<br/>• User Manuals]
      STAGE4 --> SE[🔐 Security Engineer<br/>• Security Scanning<br/>• Compliance Checks<br/>• Vulnerability Assessment]
      STAGE4 --> RE[📦 Release Engineer<br/>• Version Management<br/>• Changelog<br/>• Release Artifacts]
      STAGE4 --> DE[🚀 DevOps Engineer<br/>• Infrastructure as Code<br/>• CI/CD Pipelines<br/>• Deployment Automation]

      TW --> GATE4{🚦 Production Ready<br/>HITL Gate}
      SE --> GATE4
      RE --> GATE4
      DE --> GATE4

      %% Stage 5: Go Live & Operations (Optional)
      GATE4 -->|Approved| STAGE5[🌐 Go Live & Operations]
      STAGE5 --> SRE1[🚀 SRE Deploy Engineer<br/>• Platform Deployment<br/>• Domain Configuration<br/>• Environment Management]
      STAGE5 --> SRE2[🛡️ SRE Ops Engineer<br/>• Monitoring<br/>• Alerting<br/>• Incident Response]

      SRE1 --> GATE5{🚦 Launch<br/>HITL Gate}
      SRE2 --> GATE5

      %% Utility Agent
      BF[🐛 Bug Fixer<br/>• Error Diagnosis<br/>• Systematic Fixes<br/>• Build Validation]
      BF -.->|/ts-fix| STAGE3
      BF -.->|On Demand| STAGE4

      %% Final Output
      GATE5 -->|Approved| OUTPUT[🎉 Production System<br/>• Full-Stack Application<br/>• Tests & Documentation<br/>• CI/CD & Monitoring<br/>• 13+ Deployment Options]

      %% Turbo Mode (Autonomous)
      FA -.->|/ts-turbo<br/>Bypass Gates| TURBO[⚡ Turbo Mode<br/>Autonomous Execution<br/>Stages 1-4]
      TURBO -.-> OUTPUT

      %% Core Commands
      CMD[📋 Core Commands<br/>/ts-new-project<br/>/ts-status<br/>/ts-approve<br/>/ts-review<br/>/ts-help]
      CMD -.-> FA

      %% Style Classes
      classDef advisor fill:#FFE4B5,stroke:#D2691E,stroke-width:3px
      classDef stage fill:#E6F3FF,stroke:#4169E1,stroke-width:2px
      classDef agent fill:#F0FFF0,stroke:#32CD32,stroke-width:1px
      classDef gate fill:#FFE4E1,stroke:#DC143C,stroke-width:2px
      classDef util fill:#F5F5DC,stroke:#8B4513,stroke-width:2px
      classDef output fill:#E0FFE0,stroke:#228B22,stroke-width:3px
      classDef turbo fill:#FFB6C1,stroke:#FF1493,stroke-width:2px

      class FA advisor
      class STAGE1,STAGE2,STAGE3,STAGE4,STAGE5 stage
      class SA,PL,PP,BA,PD,QA,DB,BE,FE,IE,TW,SE,RE,DE,SRE1,SRE2 agent
      class GATE1,GATE2,GATE3,GATE4,GATE5 gate
      class BF util
      class OUTPUT output
      class TURBO turbo
